WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Brother with defensive talents

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,800
Give the people around you a break

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,920
at the front

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,360
No effort now

5
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,760
Wait until teammates die

6
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,240
You won't survive either

7
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,520
Brother Li is right

8
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,720
My talent can create a five-meter ice shield

9
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,800
I'll be a meal

10
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,040
at the front

11
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,600
Everyone is optimistic about this wave

12
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,160
Be sure to tell the boss when you go back

13
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,320
I tried my best

14
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,800
We are all on the same floor

15
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,600
Who dares to fish in troubled waters?

16
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,920
stabbed one's own

17
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,360
Unless he doesn't want to go back

18
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,440
Can't kill

19
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:30,100
Let Boss Chen see our strength.

20
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,420
Why are there explosives?

21
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,610
Has someone already built a thermal weapon?

22
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:39,130
That's just a joke, you madman

23
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,250
What a lunatic. How could he be like this?

24
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,010
The punitive uncle who takes revenge on society

25
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,520
What happened over there?

26
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,320
There's a madman on the 31st hole.
